  "prefLabel": "Puc 402.04 Competitive Local Exchange Carrier (CLEC)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 402.04 \"Competitive Local Exchange Carrier (CLEC)\" means a carrier, and its successors and assigns, authorized by the commission after July 23, 1995 to provide telephone service for the public in a particular area within New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24",
